\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {13}{\ignorespaces Predicted disaster damages for Lao PDR under four IPCC scenarios. Thinner segments correspond to the 80\% probability intervals, thicker segments to the 50\% intervals. The tails of the damage distribution grow substantially under higher-emission scenarios.}}{17}{figure.caption.15}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:dmg_scenarios}{{13}{17}{Predicted disaster damages for Lao PDR under four IPCC scenarios. Thinner segments correspond to the 80\% probability intervals, thicker segments to the 50\% intervals. The tails of the damage distribution grow substantially under higher-emission scenarios}{figure.caption.15}{}}
