\newlabel{fig:ry10}{{14}{18}{Estimated 10-year return period damages (USD millions) under four IPCC scenarios for 2030, 2045, and 2055. Even for relatively frequent events, the gap between low and high emission scenarios is substantial}{figure.caption.16}{}}
